I played back your game, and I have one suggestion that you may wish to 
follow if you want to use conducts like you're stating (although 
farmless is not a conduct, much as some might like it to be):

Don't kill Rodney for the Book of the Dead until you have at least 
collected the other invocation artifacts AND marked the Vibrating 
Square!  Every turn you spend after waking him up should be spent only 
for the purpose of getting the Amulet of Yendor and racing up to the 
elemental planes, especially if you want the conducts to stay intact.

Good luck in your future attempts, and congratulations on saving this 
game despite breaking your intentions ;)

